SELECT_END
* T1-2-1
/ 아이템상인과의 대화
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ GIVE NUM 31
@ TALK "Are you planning on crossing the Dinyc?"
@ TALK "...."
@ TALK "I wouldn't recommend you do that."
@ TALK "Not if you want to live!"
@ TALK "There are countless Demons near the Dinyc..."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "We used to go there in the old days..."
@ TALK "until Demons started appearing"
@ TALK "and slaughtering our kinfolk."
@ TALK "If you decide to risk going there"
@ TALK "be extremely careful. You'll see..."
@ TALK "there are dead bodies everywhere."
@ WAIT
@ GO_UP 아이템상인명령1
@ END


