@ TALK "I've heard the sealed sword is hidden... " 
@ TALK "somewhere near the Dark village."
@ TALK "That's all I know. Don't ask me any more."
@ TALK "I have to go back to work."
@ GIVE N-UM 34 
@ WAIT
@ GO_UP T4-2
@ END


