* 점보기
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 6 "A Witch at wizard hall" 240 20 190
@ COLOR 240 20 190
@ TALK "I'll tell your fortune for 100 gold pieces."     
@ TALK "Would you like to know your fate?"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ IF MONEY GE 100 THEN GO_DOWN OK1
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "I can't afford it now. I'll come again."
@ WAIT
@ END
* OK1
@ SELECT 255 255 255
CASE "Yes! Tell me about my future" GO_DOWN T1
CASE "No! I don't believe it!" GO_UP 마법소명령
SELECT_END
* T1
@ IF NUM HAVE 3 THEN GO_DOWN T3
@ IF NUM HAVE 2 THEN GO_DOWN T2
@ TALK "Your name is Elim.... Correct? You were a member"
@ TALK "of Shilla? You will save many people's lives."
@ TALK "But. Be careful about a woman whose name"
@ TALK "begins with S...."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "You will make it through as a Blood Trinity."
@ IF STRENGTH GE 20 THEN GO_DOWN S1
@ IF STRENGTH GE 10 THEN GO_DOWN S2
@ TALK "You will acquire a great power."
@ TALK "You will save the world from Demons."
@ TALK ""
@ TALK "100 gold pieces now if you please!"
@ WAIT
@ REMOVE MONEY 100
@ END
* S1
@ TALK "Prepare yourself to fight against the Demons."
@ TALK ""
@ TALK "100 Gold pieces. And remember - no refunds!"
@ WAIT
@ REMOVE MONEY 100
@ END
* S2
@ TALK "You must acquire various experiences."
@ TALK "Prepare yourself for the future."
@ TALK ""
@ TALK "100 gold pieces, Thank you!"
@ WAIT
@ REMOVE MONEY 100
@ END
* T2
@ TALK "You are Kusa. You are good at magic."
@ TALK "Moreover you hate Demons, but..." 
@ TALK "negative Karma will be influencing you."
@ TALK "The wooden box on your back..."
@ TALK "I feel a disturbance, but I don't know what..."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "It's shielded with hate and terrible emotion.." 
@ TALK "Your hatred must have its roots there..." 
@ TALK "hatred of Demons."
@ WAIT
@ REMOVE MONEY 100
@ END
* T3
@ TALK "You must be Raening - you were"
@ TALK "one of princesses of China."
@ TALK "One day, you'll be a most essential person."
@ TALK "You will be saved by someone..."
@ TALK "You must survive to the end of your mission!"
@ TALK "Never put yourself at risk!"
@ WAIT
@ REMOVE MONEY 100
@ END









