41. 북괴성문 폭파시키기.
   북괴성문을 보고 나면 -> 그 옆에 보석상 노인이 생김(이벤트 42)
   만일 폭약이 있으면 이 문을 없애주고, 폭파음 찍고, 북괴성굴로 가는 워프 이벤트를  생성시킴.
# 41
# 8
# 10
# "Dragon cave gate"
# FLOW
# 100
@ IF ITEM HAVE 225 THEN GO_DOWN SUC1
@ IF NUM HAVE 42 THEN GO_DOWN TS1
@ IF ORDER HAVE 43 THEN GO_DOWN TS1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "This door is closed. What could be inside?"
@ TALK "It wouldn't open even to my magic."
@ TALK " "
@ TALK "Possibly it could be..."
@ TALK "The Dragon cave...?!"
@ NEW_OBJECT 8 39 13 1 18 42
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "Look! There's an old man by that house."
@ TALK "I can see him"
@ TALK "Maybe he knows something about this door."
@ WAIT
@ END

* TS1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "It's a strong door!"
@ TALK "We'll need explosives to open this one."
@ WAIT
@ END

* SUC1
/폭약으로 문을 부숨
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "This looks like what we need."
@ TALK "Let's set the explosives around the door."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "All ready?"
@ TALK "OK, light the explosives."
@ WAIT
@ PLAY 32.WAV
@ REMOVE ITEM 225 
@ CHANGE_GOS 62
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "We shattered the door!"
@ TALK "Now, we can get into the cave."
@ TALK ""
@ TALK "Get moving!"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ TALK "Its creepy in here!"
@ TALK "Demons could be hiding anywhere."
@ TALK "Be prepared for a surprise attack!"
@ WAIT
@ LOCATE_ENEMY 8 58 5 37 30 0
@ LOCATE_ENEMY 8 59 7 37 31 0
@ LOCATE_ENEMY 8 60 5 37 33 0
@ LOCATE_ENEMY 8 61 7 37 32 0
@ LOCATE_ENEMY 8 57 5 37 23 0
@ LOCATE_ENEMY 8 58 7 37 27 0
@ LOCATE_ENEMY 8 60 7 37 30 0
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ NEW_OBJECT 8 59 3 11 62 53
@ REMOVE_OBJECT 8 1
@ REMOVE_OBJECT THIS
@ END


# 42
# 8
# 1
# "Patewoos"
# FLOW
# 100
@ IF ITEM HAVE 225 THEN GO_DOWN S2
@ IF NUM HAVE 43 THEN GO_DOWN S1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Ancient one. May I ask you something?"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 11 "Old man" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "Yes?" 
@ TALK "I suppose you want to know about that door?"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ SELECT 255 255 255
CASE "Yes! What's behind the door?" GO_DOWN T1         
SELECT_END
* T1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE 11 "Old man" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "That's the entrance to Dragon Cave." 
@ TALK "My son is imprisoned there."
@ TALK "But I can do nothing for him."
@ TALK "Will you help me?"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "I really would like to help you"
@ TALK "but the door is sealed shut."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE 11 "Old man" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "You could break the seal with explosives."
@ TALK "But first you need to find some."
@ TALK "Once you blow up the door Demons will"
@ TALK "come rushing out of the cave."
@ WAIT
* S1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Look! I will try and save your son."
@ TALK "You must tell me where to find explosives."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE 11 "Old man" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "Well, then..."
@ TALK "The blacksmith at the Stone village is"
@ TALK "the only man I know who makes explosives."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Hmm... I understand."
@ TALK "I'll go and get the explosives from him."
@ GIVE NUM_TO_ALL 42
@ WAIT
@ END
* S2
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 11 "Patewoos" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Let's break down the door."
@ TALK "You are a true Blood Trinity of heroes..."
@ WAIT
@ END


* BOMB1
/ 북괴성마을 대장장이가 NUM42를 채크해서 폭약에 필요한 재료를 구해오라고 시킴
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "Are you thinking about breaking down"
@ TALK "the Dragon cave gate "
@ TALK "to get in the Dragon Cave?"
@ TALK "You are brave. But, if you do it,"
@ TALK "you must face the consequences."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "I've heard the old man's son is imprisoned"
@ TALK "behind the door, but what can I do?"
@ TALK "Demon Hunters like you are his only hope."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "Patewoos! I've know him. He used to live here."
@ TALK "He was the greatest demon hunter. Have you met him?"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "That's true. He knows how to make explosives."
@ TALK "He told me that the door will be opened only"
@ TALK "by explosives."
@ TALK "Let's make some. I'll pay you for it."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "We need Isinglass and Artemisia to make explosives."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "OK. I'll find them."
@ TALK "Tell me where to go."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "You can get Isinglass from the Item Merchant" 
@ TALK "at the Eastern Village."
@ TALK "And... let me think... Artemisia?"
@ TALK "Well... rumor says you can obtain it" 
@ TALK "if you kill the white tiger at Carnivore Coast."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Hmm... OK! I'll leave immediately."
@ TALK "Give us a few days."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE 8 "Blacksmith" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "Wait a minute. I have something to give you."
@ TALK "It's a shield I've created."
@ TALK "It took me three years to make."
@ TALK "It'll protect you. It may even save your life."
@ GIVE ITEM 67 1
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Thank you! I'll return with the ingredients"
@ TALK "as soon as possible."
@ TALK "See you later"
@ IF ORDER_SPACE NOTHAVE THEN GO_DOWN NO_SPACE
@ ORDER 43 "Get Isinglass and Artemisia."
MENT "Bring it to Blacksmith at Stone village."
MENT "If you kill White tiger at Carnivore Coast,"
MENT "you'll get Artemisia."
MENT "Get Isinglass from Item Merchant at Eastern Village."
MENT " "
MENT "You should make explosives and break" 
MENT "Dragon cave door to save son of Patewoos."

ORDER_END
@ LOCATE_ENEMY 11 11 41 24 45 223
@ GIVE NUM_TO_ALL 43
@ REMOVE NUM_TO_ALL 42
@ WAIT
