34. 지하세계로.
  향진마귀를 죽이고, 드디어 지하세계로 갈 수 있게 되었다.
# 34
# 19
# 20
# " "
# BASIC
# 100
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX RED 5
@ FACE 20 "Hellminor" 250 50 50
@ COLOR 250 50 50
@ TALK "Arghh..., you defeated me."
@ TALK "Now all the demons in the world" 
@ TALK "will disappear in the night."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 0 "Elim" 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Hurray! we've done it!"
@ TALK "Finally all the demons in the world are gone."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE 20 "Hellminor" 250 50 50
@ COLOR 250 50 50
@ TALK "Don't be too happy yet. The demons aren't dead."
@ TALK "All the demons have returned to the underworld"
@ TALK "ruled by Satan."
@ TALK "Satan... He is the head of all of us."
@ TALK "He is invincible!"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 2 "Kusa" 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Satan! I wonder how we can fight against him?"
@ WAIT
