@ TALK "just follow my spirit."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 1 "Raening" 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Let's follow it"
@ TALK "to the underworld."
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
