=========================================================
  / 아이템상인의 조약돌을 찾아줌
=========================================================

107 : 수정 조약돌 탐색.
    103년 서역마을. 아이템상인. 자기 딸이 가지고 놀던 조약돌을 찾아달라.
    세못에 수형귀(5)를 1마리 생성시킴.(레벨 16). 죽이면 조약돌(204)을 얻음.
    가져다 주면 인삼과(167), 성자의 구슬(159), 수정(195), 천리안(196)을 준다.
# 107
# 15
# 3
# "Item Merchant"
# FLOW
# 103
@ IF ITEM HAVE 204 && ORDER HAVE 107 THEN GO_DOWN SUC1
@ IF NUM HAVE 107 && ORDER NOTHAVE 107 THEN GO_DOWN S1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ TALK "Are you looking for something?"
@ TALK " "
@ SELECT 255 255 255
CASE "Chat" GO_DOWN STEP1
CASE "About products" GO_BASIC_EVENT
SELECT_END

* STEP1
@ IF ORDER HAVE 107 THEN GO_DOWN NEXT1
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ BOX BLUE 5
@ FACE 5 "Item Merchant" 210 210 210
@ COLOR 210 210 210
@ TALK "Do you fight well against demons?"
@ TALK "I have a problem with my daughter."
@ TALK "Would you help me?"
@ WAIT
@ CLEAR_BUFFER
@ FACE HERO 250 250 0
@ COLOR 250 250 0
@ SELECT 255 255 255
CASE "Tell me about it!" GO_DOWN T1
CASE "I'm sorry, but, I'm in hurry." GO_DOWN NO1
SELECT_END

